## Why this covers everything

These are the only two places the report package consumes records: `Aggregate` delegates to `Summary.Observe`, and `Distinct` iterates batches directly (grep of the package confirms no other entry point touches `batch.Records`). `Render` only formats what `Observe` already accumulated, so it needed no change. Because the filtering happens at the report layer rather than in the pipeline, correctness no longer depends on users configuring the `filter` stage — invalid records are excluded whether or not it runs.

